  "solution": {
    "brief": "Wasp example 25: continuing topics",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: Tutorial 26 (wasp_26) directly continues from tutorial 25, extending the series with contour-field techniques alongside the established iso-curve, gradient-visualization, and attribute-driven discrete aggregation workflows. Tutorial 25 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 26.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: The attribute-driven aggregation techniques in wasp_25 are closely related to smart-attribute workflows (as in wasp_stochastic_aggregation_smart_attributes), where part attributes directly influence connection selection and assembly behavior. Smart attributes extend the attribute-based approach with directional connection logic and stochastic rule evaluation.",
